    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so hard to reconcile that with how we're taught to think. everyone says you should \"hold on\" or \"keep fighting\" no matter what, but it feels like they’re just asking us to be masochists. if the situation is truly hopeless, isn't there actually a kind of mercy in just being able to step away?",
